🔹 Destructuring kya hota hai?
Destructuring ka use hum array ya object ke values ko alag-alag variables mein todne (extract karne) ke liye karte hain — bina manually likhe.

✅ Array Destructuring
javascript

const numbers = [10, 20, 30];
const [a, b, c] = numbers;
console.log(a); // 10
Explanation:
numbers ek array hai. Humne uske pehle 3 elements ko directly a, b, c mein le liya.

👉 Agar beech ka value skip karna ho:

javascript

const [x, , z] = numbers;
console.log(z); // 30
✅ Object Destructuring
javascript

const person = { name: "Vinayak", age: 25 };
const { name, age } = person;
console.log(name); // Vinayak
Explanation:
person ek object hai. Humne usme se name aur age directly nikaal liya.

👉 Variable ka naam change karna ho:

javascript

const { name: fullName } = person;
console.log(fullName); // Vinayak
🔹 Destructuring ke Fayde:
Code short aur clean banata hai.

React mein props ya API se data nikaalne ke liye bahut useful hai.

Bar-bar dot (.) use karne ki zarurat nahi.
